1. A method of assembling a modular electrical wiring device assembly, the method comprising:

providing a frame configured to be mounted over a wall box, the frame defining at least one modular opening;

selecting a modular electrical device from a plurality of modular electrical devices sized to be received in the at least one modular opening;

orienting the selected modular electrical device in a first orientation relative to the frame or in a second orientation relative to the frame, the second orientation being substantially orthogonal to the first orientation;

inserting the selected modular electrical device into the at least one modular opening in the selected one of the first orientation and the second orientation; and

securing the selected modular electrical device to the frame such that the selected modular electrical device is supported by the frame over the wall box in the selected orientation.
